NAME
    gcloud beta backup-dr backup-plan-revisions - view Backup and DR backup
        plan revisions

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud beta backup-dr backup-plan-revisions COMMAND [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    (BETA) View Backup and DR backup plan revisions.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     describe
        (BETA) Show details of the backup plan revision.

     list
        (BETA) List backup plan revisions.

NOTES
    This command is currently in beta and might change without notice. These
    variants are also available:

        $ gcloud backup-dr backup-plan-revisions

        $ gcloud alpha backup-dr backup-plan-revisions

